## Dimension 2: Information Governance
### Applicable Guardrails
- **IG-001:** Data Minimisation — only email, chat history, page URL, and timestamp collected; no additional personal data
- **IG-003:** Lawful Basis — email address is personal data under UK GDPR
### GDPR Articles
- **Article 6 Lawful Basis:** Legitimate interest (likely) — [UNVERIFIED — IG-OWNER: TBD — RESOLUTION DATE: TBD — GO-LIVE BLOCKER]
- **Article 5(1)(c):** Data minimisation — only data necessary for escalation collected
### Data Handling Requirements
- **Data Categories:** Contact data (email address), behavioural data (chat history, page URL)
- **Data Subjects:** External partner developers
- **Retention Period:** TBD — to be confirmed with IG owner; recommend deletion after escalation is resolved
- **Data Minimisation:** Email, chat history, triggering question, page URL, timestamp only — no additional fields
