## Dimension 4: Observability & Performance
### Product KPIs
- **KPI 1:** Escalation rate — % of conversations that result in escalation (target: decreasing over time as bot improves)
- **KPI 2:** Webhook delivery success rate — target: > 99%
- **KPI 3:** Confirmation email delivery rate — target: > 99%
### Observable Events (OTEL Instrumentation)
- **Span 1:** `qabot.escalation.triggered` — Attributes: page_url, conversation_length, triggering_question
- **Span 2:** `qabot.escalation.email_submitted` — Attributes: timestamp, email_domain (not full address)
- **Span 3:** `qabot.escalation.webhook_dispatched` — Attributes: status_code, duration_ms
- **Span 4:** `qabot.escalation.confirmation_email_sent` — Attributes: status, duration_ms
### Performance SLOs
- **Webhook + confirmation email dispatched:** within 5s of submission
- **Availability:** > 99.9%
- **Error Rate:** < 0.1%
### Alerting Conditions
- **Critical:** Webhook delivery failure → alert via monitoring channel
- **Warning:** Confirmation email delivery failure rate > 1% → alert via monitoring channel
